#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:55
#: b6ae8f759b6246619c23b5d174d37ae1
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:57
#: fad8e370c1e94dd48ac145cee1921ea3
msgid "RC input is configured by default via the USART2 RX input. It supports all serial RC protocols except PPM."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:59
#: bac8c44103114225b03ebd432925e4f4
msgid "Note: If the receiver is FPort the receiver must be tied to the USART2 TX pin , RSSI_TYPE set to 3, and SERIAL2_OPTIONS must be set to 7 (invert TX/RX, half duplex). For full duplex like CRSF/ELRS use both RX1 and TX1 and set RSSI_TYPE also to 3."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:64
#: 21da4a8efb3243d5893ad2769734df03
msgid "FrSky Telemetry"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:66
#: 743e1f2d83d84e7cb455988b7d8bf7dc
msgid "FrSky Telemetry is supported using an unused UART, such as the T3 pin (UART3 transmit). You need to set the following parameters to enable support for FrSky S.PORT:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:70
#: 89935eb5be144f098237cfa1ab440e46
msgid "SERIAL3_PROTOCOL 10"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:71
#: cdee0f02c9074732a40b8f9229df51a3
msgid "SERIAL3_OPTIONS 7"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:74
#: bfefb30d21dd4d9b9abde08a8e5b921d
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:76
#: 29ef686c74d2403e9ae61d84c118bd13
msgid "The Flywoo H743 Pro supports OSD using OSD_TYPE 1 (MAX7456 driver) and simultaneously DisplayPort using TX8/RX8 on the HD VTX connector."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:79
#: 0afdefed7a3d456faecb2820fdb01f63
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:81
#: 65eb77b6e59649feab112b1b0468e8df
msgid "The Flywoo H743 Pro supports up to 13 PWM or DShot outputs. The pads for motor output M1 to M8 are provided on both the motor connectors and on separate pads, plus M9-13 on a separate pads for LED strip and other PWM outputs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:85
#: f87156726391431791a6740dd7463456
msgid "The PWM is in 4 groups:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:88
#: 48431f016d9a4b7ab9232663670e81eb
msgid "PWM 1-2   in group1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:89
#: 13034a8596c14ccb8c33989142b9c1f5
msgid "PWM 3-6   in group2"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:90
#: 1f4a1a1ebf9a4b0eac60089a60e27579
msgid "PWM 7-10  in group3"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:91
#: 78999b9650ed4a409380cb44bd5a4672
msgid "PWM 11-12 in group4"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:92
#: 3c9a6e98437741e98c3728c3e2816ac0
msgid "PWM 13    in group5"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:94
#: 03fbf9d1fa8d4789986761f9e92934bc
msgid "Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate. If any channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the group need to use DShot. Channels 1-10 support bi-directional dshot."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:99
#: 40ce26e0283a45f3babff98b97a46475
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:101
#: c6200b34e8bf4929b5cf2c0482494969
msgid "The board has a built-in voltage sensor and external current sensor input. The current sensor can read up to 130 Amps. The voltage sensor can handle up to 6S LiPo batteries."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:105
#: 253ad199628744a393136f9d764bd704
msgid "The correct battery setting parameters are:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-flywoo-h743.rst:108
